xt iconList__section__title" style="box-sizing:border-box">Warum auf cathaypacific.com buchen?</div><div class="link -rightIcon iconList__link"><span class="c-rich-text" style="box-sizing:border-box">Erfahren Sie mehr</span><span class="link__icon"><span style="margin-left:8px" role="img" class="cxicon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 7" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="m11 0 5 3.5L11 7V4H0V3h11z"></path></svg></span></span></div></div><div class="iconList__icon" style="width:75%"><div class="iconListItem iconListItem--3"><div class="iconListItem__wrapper"><div><img alt="icon" src="/content/dam/focal-point/digital-library/svg-icons/icon3-0/default-dark-grey/lifestyle/moneydollar.svg"/></div><div><div class="-contentBox"><div><div class="c-rich-text iconListItem__title" style="box-sizing:border-box" data-testid="icon-item-title">Toller Mehrwert</div><div class="c-rich-text iconListItem__desc" style="box-sizing:border-box" data-testid="icon-item-desc"><p>Sammeln Sie zusätzliche Asia Miles und profitieren Sie von sofortigen Rabatten, wenn Sie direkt bei uns buchen*. </p>
<p>* Je nach Verfügbarkeit</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="iconListItem iconListItem--3"><div class="iconListItem__wrapper"><div><img alt="icon" src="/content/dam/focal-point/digital-library/svg-icons/icon3-0/default-dark-grey/universal/heart.svg"/></div><div><div class="-contentBox"><div><div class="c-rich-text iconListItem__title" style="box-sizing:border-box" data-testid="icon-item-title">Größtmögliche Sicherheit</div><div class="c-rich-text iconListItem__desc" style="box-sizing:border-box" data-testid="icon-item-desc"><p>Kostenlose 24 Stunden Stornierung für Cathay Mitglieder* </p>
