</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="iconListItem iconListItem--3"><div class="iconListItem__wrapper"><div><img alt="icon" src="/content/dam/focal-point/digital-library/svg-icons/icon3-0/default-dark-grey/lifestyle/booking.svg"/></div><div><div class="-contentBox"><div><div class="c-rich-text iconListItem__title" style="box-sizing:border-box" data-testid="icon-item-title">Maximale Flexibilität</div><div class="c-rich-text iconListItem__desc" style="box-sizing:border-box" data-testid="icon-item-desc"><p>Mit der Funktion "Meine Buchung verwalten" können Sie Ihre Buchung ganz einfach anpassen, ändern oder stornieren.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></a></div><!--/$--><div></div></div><div class="  aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><!--$--><div class="cmp-pillarBlock -left -pillarBlock" style="box-sizing:border-box;--container-bg:linear-gradient(180deg, #F1F4F1 0%, transparent 100%)"><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__background -left"><div class="col-4 col-m-5 col-l-9 offset-0 offset-m-0 offset-l-0 cmp-pillarBlock__background-container"><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__background-fill"></div></div></div><div class="c-grid container"><div class="row"><div class="col-4 col-m-8 col-l-12"><div style="box-sizing:border-box"><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__item" style="box-sizing:border-box"><div class="c-grid container cmp-pillarSectionHeading"><div class="row"><div class="col-3 col-m-7 col-l-11 cmp-pillarSectionHeading__container"><div class="cmp-pillarSectionHeading__content"><div class="cmp-pillarSectionHeading__superTitle" style="box-sizing:border-box;color:#005D63">Flugtarife und Prämien </div><h2 class="c-heading cmp-pillarSectionHeading__title" style="box-sizing:border-box" data-heading="h2" data-weight="regular"><div class="" style="box-sizing:border-box">Wählen Sie die gewünschte Buchungsart. </div></h2><div class="cmp-pillarSectionHeading__desc" style="box-sizing:border-box">Es war noch nie so einfach, Ihr nächstes Abenteuer zu buchen. Nutzen Sie Ihre Meilen oder wählen Sie den Tarif, der am besten zu Ihnen passt.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__item" style="box-sizing:border-box"><div class=""><div class="aem-container aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12"><div class="  aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><!--$--><div class="c-grid container a-pillarCard"><div class="row"><div class="col-4 col-m-8 col-l-12 pillarCard__MediaWrapper"><div class="pillarCard__wrapper -verticalBlock -twoColumn -fullWidth col-l-12 col-m-8 col-4 -rightCardAlign link" style="box-sizing:border-box"><a class="c-link pillarCard__imageWrapper " data-size="lg" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/de_DE/book-a-trip/book-flights/new-economy-fares.html" rel="" target="_self" role="link"><div class="c-link__content" aria-describedby="cathay-R2qkqbl9e"><div class="c-grid container" style="--imageAspectRatio:2/1;--imageAspectRatioMD:2/1;--imageAspectRatioSML:2/1"><div class="row"><div class="c-skeleton c-aem-img pillarCard__image -loading" style="box-sizing:border-box" data-variant="image" data-active="true"><div class="c-image -cover" style="box-sizing:border-box;--c-image-width:100%;--c-image-height:auto"><figure><picture><img alt="Meilen einlösen" loading="eager" src="https://www.cathaypacific.com/content/dam/focal-point/cx/book-a-trip/branded-fares/branded-fares_en.renditionimage.900.450.jpg"/></picture></figure></div></div></div></div></div></a><a class="c-link pillarCard__imageWrapper  pillarCard__textCardWrapper -overlap -bottomTextCard -rightCard" data-size="lg" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/de_DE/book-a-trip/book-flights/new-economy-fares.html" rel="" target="_self" role="link"><div class="c-link__content" aria-describedby="cathay-R4qkqbl9e"><div class="pillarCard__textCardContainer -containerpadding" style="box-sizing:border-box;background-color:#f9f9f9"><h3 class="pillarCard__title" style="box-sizing:border-box">Wählen Sie den Tarif, der am besten zu Ihnen passt.</h3><p class="pillarCard__description" style="box-sizing:border-box">Unsere Tarife Light, Essential und Flex bieten Ihnen mehr Auswahl und Flexibilität für Ihre nächste Reise.</p><span class="c-link pillarCard__link link" data-size="lg"><div class="c-link__content" aria-describedby="cathay-R13cqkqbl9e"><span class="c-rich-text" style="box-sizing:border-box">Mehr erfahren</span><span role="img" class="cxicon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 7" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="m11 0 5 3.5L11 7V4H0V3h11z"></path></svg></span></div></span></div></div></a></div></div></div></div><!--/$--><div></div></div></div><div></div></div></div><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__item" style="box-sizing:border-box"><div class=""><div class="aem-container aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12"><div class="  aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><!--$--><div class="c-grid container a-pillarCard"><div class="row"><div class="col-4 col-m-8 col-l-12 pillarCard__MediaWrapper"><div class="pillarCard__wrapper -verticalBlock -twoColumn -fullWidth col-l-12 col-m-8 col-4 -leftCardAlign link" style="box-sizing:border-box"><a class="c-link pillarCard__imageWrapper " data-size="lg" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/de_DE/book-a-trip/book-flights/miles-plus-cash.html" rel="" target="_self" role="link"><div class="c-link__content" aria-describedby="cathay-R2qlabl9e"><div class="c-grid container" style="--imageAspectRatio:2/1;--imageAspectRatioMD:2/1;--imageAspectRatioSML:2/1"><div class="row"><div class="c-skeleton c-aem-img pillarCard__image -loading" style="box-sizing:border-box" data-variant="image" data-active="true"><div class="c-image -cover" style="box-sizing:border-box;--c-image-width:100%;--c-image-height:auto"><figure><picture><img alt="Miles Plus Cash" loading="eager" src="https://www.cathaypacific.com/content/dam/focal-point/cx/book-a-trip/miles-plus-cash/miles-plus-cash-kv.renditionimage.900.450.jpg"/></picture></figure></div></div></div></div></div></a><a class="c-link pillarCard__imageWrapper  pillarCard__textCardWrapper -overlap -bottomTextCard -leftCard" data-size="lg" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/de_DE/book-a-trip/book-flights/miles-plus-cash.html" rel="" target="_self" role="link"><div class="c-link__content" aria-describedby="cathay-R4qlabl9e"><div class="pillarCard__textCardContainer -containerpadding" style="box-sizing:border-box;background-color:#f9f9f9"><h3 class="pillarCard__title" style="box-sizing:border-box">Miles Plus Cash nutzen</h3><p class="pillarCard__description" style="box-sizing:border-box">Buchen Sie Ihren nächsten Urlaub mit einer Kombination aus Meilen und Bargeld, die für Sie am günstigsten ist.</p><span class="c-link pillarCard__link link" data-size="lg"><div class="c-link__content" aria-describedby="cathay-R13cqlabl9e"><span class="c-rich-text" style="box-sizing:border-box">Jetzt buchen</span><span role="img" class="cxicon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 7" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="m11 0 5 3.5L11 7V4H0V3h11z"></path></svg></span></div></span></div></div></a></div></div></div></div><!--/$--><div></div></div></div><div></div></div></div><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__item" style="box-sizing:border-box"><div class=""><div class="aem-container aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12"></div><div></div></div></div><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__item" style="box-sizing:border-box"><div class=""><div class="aem-container aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12"></div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--/$--><div></div></div><div class="  aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><!--$--><div class="c-grid container cmp-pillarSectionHeading"><div class="row"><div class="col-4 col-m-8 col-l-9 cmp-pillarSectionHeading__container"><div class="cmp-pillarSectionHeading__content"><h2 class="c-heading cmp-pillarSectionHeading__title" style="box-sizing:border-box" data-heading="h2" data-weight="regular"><div class="" style="box-sizing:border-box">Gönnen Sie sich auf Ihrem nächsten Flug ein Upgrade.</div></h2><div class="cmp-pillarSectionHeading__desc" style="box-sizing:border-box">Mit Prämienupgrades, Begleittickets und Vergünstigungen an Bord können Sie sich und Ihren Liebsten ganz einfach etwas Besonderes gönnen.  </div></div></div></div></div><!--/$--><div></div></div><div class="  aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><!--$--><div class="optimizelyWrapper" data-optimizelychanges="" id="optimizelyWrapper-LifestyleOfferCard"></div><div class="container"><div class="lifestyleOfferCard margin-bottom-40"><div class="row"><div class="col-4 col-m-4 col-l-3"><div class="basicCard -withColorHex" style="--card-bg-color:#F9F9F9;--label-color-rgb:135, 122, 92;--ribbon-color-rgb:135, 122, 92"><a class="withCard" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/de_DE/book-a-trip/redeem-flights/redeem-flight-awards.html"><div class="basicCard__image"><div class="responsiveImage -withRatio" style="--imageWidth:450;--imageHeight:300;--imageWidthMD:450;--imageHeightMD:300;--imageWidthLG:450;--imageHeightLG:300"></div></div><div class="basicCard__textbox"><div><div class="equal-height-JlocK" style="height:undefinedpx;transition-duration:0.25s"><div class="basicCardContent" style="--pillar-title-color:rgb(17.7333333333%, 17.7333333333%, 17.7333333333%)"><div><h3>Upgrade-Prämien</h3><div class="basicCardContent__description"><p>Reisen Sie mit Stil, indem Sie Ihre Meilen für ein Upgrade Ihres Tickets auf die nächsthöhere Reiseklasse nutzen.</p>
</div></div><div><span class="link -rightIcon basicCard__CTA" role="button" tabindex="0"><span>Entdecken Sie mehr</span><span class="link__icon"><svg height="1em" viewBox="0 0 16 7" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11 0l5 3.5L11 7V4H0V3h11V0z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></a></div></div><div class="col-4 col-m-4 col-l-3"><div class="basicCard -withColorHex" style="--card-bg-color:#F9F9F9;--label-color-rgb:135, 122, 92;--ribbon-color-rgb:135, 122, 92"><a class="withCard" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/de_DE/book-a-trip/redeem-flights/redeem-flight-awards.html"><div class="basicCard__image"><div class="responsiveImage -withRatio" style="--imageWidth:450;--imageHeight:300;--imageWidthMD:450;--imageHeightMD:300;--imageWidthLG:450;--imageHeightLG:300"></div></div><div class="basicCard__textbox"><div><div class="equal-height-JlocK" style="height:undefinedpx;transition-duration:0.25s"><div class="basicCardContent" style="--pillar-title-color:rgb(17.7333333333%, 17.7333333333%, 17.7333333333%)"><div><h3>Begleitertickets</h3><div class="basicCardContent__description"><p>Sie können Ihre Asia Miles gegen ein Begleiterticket für einen Mitreisenden einlösen.</p>
</div></div><div><span class="link -rightIcon basicCard__CTA" role="button" tabindex="0"><span>Entdecken Sie mehr</span><span class="link__icon"><svg height="1em" viewBox="0 0 16 7" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11 0l5 3.5L11 7V4H0V3h11V0z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></a></div></div><div class="col-4 col-m-4 col-l-3"><div class="basicCard -withColorHex" style="--card-bg-color:#F9F9F9;--label-color-rgb:135, 122, 92;--ribbon-color-rgb:135, 122, 92"><a class="withCard" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/de_DE/baggage/extra-baggage-charges/pay-cash-or-by-credit-card.html"><div class="basicCard__image"><div class="responsiveImage -withRatio" style="--imageWidth:450;--imageHeight:300;--imageWidthMD:450;--imageHeightMD:300;--imageWidthLG:450;--imageHeightLG:300"></div></div><div class="basicCard__textbox"><div><div class="equal-height-JlocK" style="height:undefinedpx;transition-duration:0.25s"><div class="basicCardContent" style="--pillar-title-color:rgb(17.7333333333%, 17.7333333333%, 17.7333333333%)"><div><h3>Zusätzliches Gepäck</h3><div class="basicCardContent__description"><p>Reisen Sie mit zusätzlichem Gepäck? Sparen Sie Gebühren auf zusätzliches Gepäck, indem Sie Ihre Meilen gegen eine größere Freigepäckmenge einlösen.</p>
</div></div><div><span class="link -rightIcon basicCard__CTA" role="button" tabindex="0"><span>Entdecken Sie mehr</span><span class="link__icon"><svg height="1em" viewBox="0 0 16 7" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11 0l5 3.5L11 7V4H0V3h11V0z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></a></div></div><div class="col-4 col-m-4 col-l-3"><div class="basicCard -withColorHex" style="--card-bg-color:#F9F9F9;--label-color-rgb:135, 122, 92;--ribbon-color-rgb:135, 122, 92"><a class="withCard" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/de_DE/manage-booking/travel-extras/reserve-your-seat.html"><div class="basicCard__image"><div class="responsiveImage -withRatio" style="--imageWidth:450;--imageHeight:300;--imageWidthMD:450;--imageHeightMD:300;--imageWidthLG:450;--imageHeightLG:300"></div></div><div class="basicCard__textbox"><div><div class="equal-height-JlocK" style="height:undefinedpx;transition-duration:0.25s"><div class="basicCardContent" style="--pillar-title-color:rgb(17.7333333333%, 17.7333333333%, 17.7333333333%)"><div><h3>Mehr Beinfreiheit</h3><div class="basicCardContent__description"><p>Fliegen Sie in der Economy Class mit zusätzlichem Komfort, indem Sie Ihre Meilen gegen Sitzplätze mit mehr Bewegungsfreiheit einlösen.</p>
</div></div><div><span class="link -rightIcon basicCard__CTA" role="button" tabindex="0"><span>Entdecken Sie mehr</span><span class="link__icon"><svg height="1em" viewBox="0 0 16 7" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11 0l5 3.5L11 7V4H0V3h11V0z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><!--/$--><div></div></div><div class="  aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><!--$--><div class="cmp-pillarBlock -fullWidth -pillarBlock" style="box-sizing:border-box;--container-bg:linear-gradient(180deg, #F1F4F1 0%, transparent 100%)"><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__background -fullWidth"><div class="col-4 col-m-8 col-l-12 offset-0 offset-m-0 offset-l-0 cmp-pillarBlock__background-container"><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__background-fill"></div></div></div><div class="c-grid container"><div class="row"><div class="col-4 col-m-8 col-l-12"><div style="box-sizing:border-box"><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__item" style="box-sizing:border-box"><div class="c-grid container cmp-pillarSectionHeading -fullwidth"><div class="row"><div class="col-4 col-m-8 col-l-12 cmp-pillarSectionHeading__container"><div class="cmp-pillarSectionHeading__content"><h2 class="c-heading cmp-pillarSectionHeading__title" style="box-sizing:border-box" data-heading="h2" data-weight="regular"><div class="" style="box-sizing:border-box"> </div></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__item" style="box-sizing:border-box"><div class=""><div class="aem-container aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12"><div class="  aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><!--$--><div class="c-grid container a-pillarCard"><div class="row"><div class="col-4 col-m-8 col-l-12 pillarCard__MediaWrapper"><div class="pillarCard__wrapper -horizontalBlock -fullWidth col-l-12 col-m-8 col-4 -middleCardAlign -leftImageAlign -verticalMedium link" style="box-sizing:border-box"><a class="c-link pillarCard__imageWrapper -landscapeImageHorizontal " data-size="lg" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/en_HK/inspiration.html" rel="" target="_self" role="link"><div class="c-link__content" aria-describedby="cathay-Rbaqd59e"><div class="c-grid container" style="--imageAspectRatio:3/2;--imageAspectRatioMD:3/2;--imageAspectRatioSML:3/2"><div class="row"><div class="c-skeleton c-aem-img pillarCard__image -loading" style="box-sizing:border-box" data-variant="image" data-active="true"><div class="c-image -cover" style="box-sizing:border-box;--c-image-width:100%;--c-image-height:auto"><figure><picture><img alt="Inspirationen für Flüge" loading="eager" src="https://www.cathaypacific.com/content/dam/focal-point/digital-library/global-marketing/lrp/inspiration-flights.renditionimage.900.600.jpg"/></picture></figure></div></div></div></div></div></a><a class="c-link pillarCard__imageWrapper -landscapeImageHorizontal  pillarCard__textCardWrapper -landscapeTextCard -overlap -sideTextCard -middleCard -rightCard" data-size="lg" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/en_HK/inspiration.html" rel="" target="_self" role="link"><div class="c-link__content" aria-describedby="cathay-Rjaqd59e"><div class="pillarCard__textCardContainer -containerpadding" style="box-sizing:border-box;background-color:#f9f9f9"><div class="pillarCard__pillarTitle" style="box-sizing:border-box;color:#005D63">Inspiration</div><h2 class="pillarCard__title" style="box-sizing:border-box">Für Ihren nächsten Flug …</h2><p class="pillarCard__description" style="box-sizing:border-box">Entdecken Sie mit uns die Welt und profitieren Sie von unserer modernen Flotte und unserem hervorragenden Service.</p><span class="c-link pillarCard__link link" data-size="lg"><div class="c-link__content" aria-describedby="cathay-R4djaqd59e"><span class="c-rich-text" style="box-sizing:border-box">Weiterlesen</span><span role="img" class="cxicon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 7" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="m11 0 5 3.5L11 7V4H0V3h11z"></path></svg></span></div></span></div></div></a></div></div></div></div><!--/$--><div></div></div></div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--/$--><div></div></div><div class="  aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><!--$--><div class="cmp-pillarBlock -fullWidth -pillarBlock" style="box-sizing:border-box;--container-bg:linear-gradient(180deg, #F1F4F1 0%, transparent 100%)"><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__background -fullWidth"><div class="col-4 col-m-8 col-l-12 offset-0 offset-m-0 offset-l-0 cmp-pillarBlock__background-container"><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__background-fill"></div></div></div><div class="c-grid container"><div class="row"><div class="col-4 col-m-8 col-l-12"><div style="box-sizing:border-box"><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__item" style="box-sizing:border-box"><div class="c-grid container cmp-pillarSectionHeading -fullwidth"><div class="row"><div class="col-4 col-m-8 col-l-12 cmp-pillarSectionHeading__container"><div class="cmp-pillarSectionHeading__content"><div class="cmp-pillarSectionHeading__superTitle" style="box-sizing:border-box;color:#F1F4F1"> </div><h2 class="c-heading cmp-pillarSectionHeading__title" style="box-sizing:border-box" data-heading="h2" data-weight="regular"><div class="" style="box-sizing:border-box">Fliegen mit uns</div></h2><div class="cmp-pillarSectionHeading__desc" style="box-sizing:border-box">Entdecken Sie all die kleinen Details, die das Fliegen mit uns zu einem besonderen Erlebnis machen – vom Speisen an Bord bis hin zur Unterhaltung und vielem mehr.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cmp-pillarBlock__item" style="box-sizing:border-box"><div class=""><div class="aem-container aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12"><div class="  aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><!--$--><div class="optimizelyWrapper" data-optimizelychanges="" id="optimizelyWrapper-LifestyleOfferCard"></div><div class="container"><div class="lifestyleOfferCard"><div class="row"><div class="col-4 col-m-4 col-l-3"><div class="fullImageCard"><a class="withCard" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/de_DE/flying-with-us/aircraft-and-fleet.html"><div class="fullImageCard__image"><div class="fullImageCard__responsiveImage responsiveImage -withRatio" style="--imageWidth:600;--imageHeight:900;--imageWidthMD:600;--imageHeightMD:900;--imageWidthLG:600;--imageHeightLG:900"></div><div class="fullImageCard__bottom"><h5 class="fullImageCard__title"><span class="link -rightIcon fullImageCard__link" role="button" tabindex="0"><span>Flugzeuge und flotte</span><span class="link__icon"><svg height="1em" viewBox="0 0 16 7" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11 0l5 3.5L11 7V4H0V3h11V0z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></span></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class="col-4 col-m-4 col-l-3"><div class="fullImageCard"><a class="withCard" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/de_DE/flying-with-us/flight-classes.html"><div class="fullImageCard__image"><div class="fullImageCard__responsiveImage responsiveImage -withRatio" style="--imageWidth:600;--imageHeight:900;--imageWidthMD:600;--imageHeightMD:900;--imageWidthLG:600;--imageHeightLG:900"></div><div class="fullImageCard__bottom"><h5 class="fullImageCard__title"><span class="link -rightIcon fullImageCard__link" role="button" tabindex="0"><span>Reiseklassen</span><span class="link__icon"><svg height="1em" viewBox="0 0 16 7" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11 0l5 3.5L11 7V4H0V3h11V0z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></span></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class="col-4 col-m-4 col-l-3"><div class="fullImageCard"><a class="withCard" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/de_DE/flying-with-us/using-electronic-devices/connectivity.html"><div class="fullImageCard__image"><div class="fullImageCard__responsiveImage responsiveImage -withRatio" style="--imageWidth:600;--imageHeight:900;--imageWidthMD:600;--imageHeightMD:900;--imageWidthLG:600;--imageHeightLG:900"></div><div class="fullImageCard__bottom"><h5 class="fullImageCard__title"><span class="link -rightIcon fullImageCard__link" role="button" tabindex="0"><span>WLAN und Konnektivität</span><span class="link__icon"><svg height="1em" viewBox="0 0 16 7" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11 0l5 3.5L11 7V4H0V3h11V0z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></span></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class="col-4 col-m-4 col-l-3"><div class="fullImageCard"><a class="withCard" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/de_DE/flying-with-us/inflight-dining/dining-menus.html"><div class="fullImageCard__image"><div class="fullImageCard__responsiveImage responsiveImage -withRatio" style="--imageWidth:600;--imageHeight:900;--imageWidthMD:600;--imageHeightMD:900;--imageWidthLG:600;--imageHeightLG:900"></div><div class="fullImageCard__bottom"><h5 class="fullImageCard__title"><span class="link -rightIcon fullImageCard__link" role="button" tabindex="0"><span>Speisen an Bord</span><span class="link__icon"><svg height="1em" viewBox="0 0 16 7" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11 0l5 3.5L11 7V4H0V3h11V0z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></span></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><!--/$--><div></div></div><div class="  aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><!--$--><div class="c-grid container cmp-link"><div class="row"><div class="col-4 col-m-8 col-l-12 -buttonPositionCenter"><a class="c-link -button" data-size="lg" data-color="cathay-jade" data-variant="filled" href="https://www.cathaypacific.com/cx/de_DE/flying-with-us.html"><div class="c-link__content" aria-describedby="cathay-R6aqdl9e">Mehr entdecken</div></a></div></div></div><!--/$--><div></div></div><div class="  aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><!--$--><div class="c-grid container c-aem-text -paragraph"